            "title": "Tiptree (TIPT) Profit Margin Expansion Reinforces Community Narrative of Consistent Earnings Quality",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Tiptree (TIPT) reported net profit margins of 2.4%, up from last year\u2019s 2%, with earnings growth of 24.4%, which is just below the five-year average of 26.3%. The company has posted consistent profitability over the past five years and earnings are considered high quality. With the shares trading at $17.71, just under an estimated fair value of $17.90, investors see a mix of steady earnings delivery and reasonable valuation compared to the broader industry. See our full analysis for...",
